4"],"author":"devonnull","created_at":"2026-08-24T19:08:12Z","created_at_i":1787598492,"num_comments":0,"objectID":"49424464","points":5,"story_id":49424464,"title":"African nations ramp up their space programmes a bid to reduce reliance the West","updated_at":"2026-08-24T20:54:16Z","url":"https://www.euronews.com/next/2026/08/24/african-nations-ramp-up-their-space-programmes-in-a-bid-to-reduce-reliance-on-the-west"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"yuansong98"},"story_text":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"GPU leases have become massive price bets.<p>To meet surging demand, companies are signing multi-year GPU contracts but this also means they're taking on serious duration risk in the process. Over the next 3 to 5 years, any single SKU of GPU can decline in price due to depreciation, obsolescence, or simple oversupply.<p>As a result, companies have realized that they need a hedge, but bilateral, bespoke derivatives are arcane, slow, and difficult to navigate.<p>That's why we built a self-serve pricer for cash-settled rate floors: Pick your SKU, calendar months, coverage, and floor level, and see your floor priced in about a minute.<p>Many companies have already been using this tool to paper eight-figure notional agreements. Now we're bringing it to everyone."},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: Rate Floor Pricer \u2013 like price insurance on GPU, estimated in real time"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.getcomputable.com/hedge"}},"_tags":["story","author_yuansong98","story_49424458","show_hn"],"author":"yuansong98","children":[49425162],"created_at":"2026-08-24T19:07:39Z","created_at_i":1787598459,"num_comments":2,"objectID":"49424458","points":4,"story_id":49424458,"story_text":"GPU leases have become massive price bets.<p>To meet surging demand, companies are signing multi-year GPU contracts but this also means they&#x27;re taking on serious duration risk in the process. Over the next 3 to 5 years, any single SKU of GPU can decline in price due to depreciation, obsolescence, or simple oversupply.<p>As a result, companies have realized that they need a hedge, but bilateral, bespoke derivatives are arcane, slow, and difficult to navigate.<p>That&#x27;s why we built a self-serve pricer for cash-settled rate floors: Pick your SKU, calendar months, coverage, and floor level, and see your floor priced in about a minute.<p>Many companies have already been using this tool to paper eight-figure notional agreements. Now we&#x27;re bringing it to everyone.","title":"Show HN: Rate Floor Pricer \u2013 like price insurance on GPU, estimated in real time","updated_at":"2026-08-24T21:14:30Z","url":"https://www.getcomputable.com/hedge"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"ForkFolio"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Forkfolio, a live portfolio that syncs with your GitHub every night"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://forkfolio.dev"}},"_tags":["story","author_ForkFolio","story_49424447"],"author":"ForkFolio","children":[49424448],"created_at":"2026-08-24T19:06:44Z","created_at_i":1787598404,"num_comments":0,"objectID":"49424447","points":3,"story_id":49424447,"title":"Forkfolio, a live portfolio that syncs with your GitHub every night","updated_at":"2026-08-24T19:08:46Z","url":"https://forkfolio.dev"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"dgellow"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Nvidia customers notified about AI-related price hikes above 15%"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.reuters.com/business/nvidia-customers-notified-about-ai-related-price-hikes-above-15-bloomberg-news-2026-08-22/"}},"_tags":["story","author_dgellow","story_49424444"],"author":"dgellow","created_at":"2026-08-24T19:06:30Z","created_at_i":1787598390,"num_comme